WEBVTT

1.1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.331
Step 1. Open the Medication Request form. Each time you save this form,

1.2
00:00:05.331 --> 00:00:09.767
Care groups the medicines you saved into one new prescription.

1.3
00:00:09.767 --> 00:00:13.487
Open the Medications tab, then select Create.

2.1
00:00:13.487 --> 00:00:17.983
Step 2. Select the medicine. Select the Add Medication field.

2.2
00:00:17.983 --> 00:00:23.483
The Product tab lists the active products in your facility's catalogue; search,

2.3
00:00:23.483 --> 00:00:25.723
then select the medicine.

3.1
00:00:25.723 --> 00:00:29.884
Step 3. Enter the dosage, frequency and duration.

3.2
00:00:29.884 --> 00:00:34.672
Dosage and Frequency are required, and Duration is optional.

3.3
00:00:34.672 --> 00:00:38.763
In Duration, enter a duration such as 5 days.

4.1
00:00:38.763 --> 00:00:42.092
Step 6. Add notes. This step is optional.

4.2
00:00:42.092 --> 00:00:45.996
Enter a note for one medicine in its own note field,

4.3
00:00:45.996 --> 00:00:49.950
and a note for the whole prescription in Note.

5.1
00:00:49.950 --> 00:00:53.660
Step 7. Save the medicines. Select Save Changes.

5.2
00:00:53.660 --> 00:00:58.850
Care shows Questionnaire submitted successfully, opens the Overview tab,

5.3
00:00:58.850 --> 00:01:03.242
and the medicines you saved form one new prescription.
